---
import Site from '../../../layouts/Site.astro';
import '../../../cockpit/cockpit.css';
import '../../../cockpit/projects.css';
---
<Site title="全部项目" kind="cockpit" url="/cockpit/projects/" page="cockpit-projects" toc={[]} noindex={true}>
  <div class="cp-page projects-page">
    <p id="projects-gate" role="status">这一页只给本人看</p>
    <section id="projects-owner" hidden>
      <p><a href="/cockpit/#projects">← 回驾驶舱·项目</a></p>
      <div class="projects-heading"><h1>全部项目</h1><button class="cp-btn" type="button" id="projects-refresh">重新计算</button></div>
      <p id="projects-status" role="status"></p>
      <p>样子以后跟驾驶舱一起重做。手机可左右滑动表格。</p>
      <div class="projects-table" role="region" aria-label="全部项目，可左右滑动" tabindex="0">
        <table><caption>每次打开现算；日期按北京时间，次数按最近 7 天、30 天计算。本机仓库取当前提交记录，其余取 GitHub 默认分支。</caption>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">项目</th><th scope="col">干什么用</th><th scope="col">入口</th><th scope="col">最近改动</th><th scope="col">7 天</th><th scope="col">30 天</th><th scope="col">等我</th><th scope="col">最近留的话</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="projects-rows"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Site>
<script>
  import '../../../cockpit/projects.js';
</script>
